        "code": "def allocate_long_context(window_cap, sys_tok, query_tok, output_reserve, doc_sizes):\n    reserved = sys_tok + query_tok + output_reserve\n    doc_budget = max(0, window_cap - reserved)\n    kept_docs, used = [], 0\n    for doc_id, sz in doc_sizes:\n        if used + sz <= doc_budget:\n            kept_docs.append(doc_id)\n            used += sz\n    return {\"doc_budget\": doc_budget, \"kept_docs\": kept_docs, \"used_doc_tok\": used, \"dropped\": len(doc_sizes) - len(kept_docs)}\n\ndocs = [(\"d1\", 12000), (\"d2\", 15000), (\"d3\", 10000)]\nprint(allocate_long_context(32000, sys_tok=1500, query_tok=500, output_reserve=4000, doc_sizes=docs))",
